// The Lance -- four sounds, namespaced so this drops into any mod without
// colliding with its sound names.
//
// lnc/loop is the one that matters: it is started with CHANF_LOOPING on
// CHAN_5 when the trigger goes down and pitched every tic after, so the
// approaching cook-off is audible before it is visible. CHAN_5 rather than
// a lower channel so it does not fight a mod's own weapon or item sounds.

lnc/charge    PLCHRG
lnc/loop      PLALTF
lnc/cookoff   PLCOUT
lnc/empty     AKEMPT
lnc/sizzle    AKEMPT
